# Build and Release Folders
bin-debug/
bin-release/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]in/

# Other files and folders
.settings/

# Executables
*.swf
*.air
*.ipa
*.apk

# Project files, i.e. `.project`, `.actionScriptProperties` and `.flexProperties`
# should NOT be excluded as they contain compiler settings and other important
# information for Eclipse / Flash Builder.
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
GITHUB WANTED TOOLS PRO — .gitignore
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
─── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
pycache/ *.py[cod] *$py.class *.so .Python env/ venv/ .venv/ ENV/ build/ dist/ *.egg-info/ .egg .pytest_cache/ .mypy_cache/ .ruff_cache/ .tox/ .coverage .coverage. htmlcov/ .hypothesis/ *.mo *.pot
─── Data runtime ─────────────────────────────────────────────
github_wanted_pro/ data.db data.db-shm data.db-wal *.sqlite *.sqlite3 exports/ backups/ logs/ *.log
─── OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store .DS_Store? ._* .Spotlight-V100 .Trashes ehthumbs.db Thumbs.db desktop.ini *~
─── IDE / Editors ────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/ .idea/ *.swp *.swo .project .classpath .settings/ *.sublime-workspace *.sublime-project .vim/ *.vim
─── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env .env.local .env.*.local *.pem *.key *.crt secrets/ credentials.json
─── Temp ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
tmp/ temp/ *.tmp *.bak *.old *.orig
─── Node (si ajout front) ────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/ npm-debug.log* yarn-debug.log* yarn-error.log* .pnpm-debug.log*
─── Backups locaux ───────────────────────────────────────────
.backup .backup. backup_/
─── CSV/Exports générés ──────────────────────────────────────
.csv !example.csv discussions_.json discussions_.md discussions_.csv
